  "problems": "Tables identified by their DOM classes (js-measurementsTable--women / --bottoms / --wl etc.) because the page shows them via selectors. Inches tables also published. The numeric-size conversion table has no rows for 22, 35, 36; it maps 23 to US \"x\" (omitted) and both 24 and 25 to US 0. Waist and length are separate charts (e.g. W27 L32): inseam is only in the length chart. Tops chart also gives arm length (not recorded). A third-party search summary showed a 24-44 numeric chart starting 64/78 cm: that is the MEN's table, not women's."
